  "source": "Translated by Claude (claude-opus-5-5, Anthropic) from the library's urn:menota:anonymous:vǫluspá:am-544-4to, from the Medieval Nordic Text Archive, Menota (CC BY-SA 4.0), one English line for each line of the original. Only some passages are translated so far: those that the Atlas of Ancient Myth, Magic in the Ancient Texts and the demons-and-angels study cite.",
